[Music]  for over 21 years now the world's most  famous sponge has been entertaining not  only children but also adults worldwide  with this uncomplicated humor  after it became known some time ago that  with camp corel for a spin-off about  spongebob's youth is already in the  works  spongebob sidekick patrick star will be  dedicated a separate series  according to an insider of deadline the  series will be called the patrick star  show and will be homage to the larry  sanders show from the 90s  with this the scatterbrain starfish will  become the host of his own late night  show when another aspect should not be  neglected  namely patrick's family of course other  characters of the spongebob franchise  will most likely also appear in the 13  planned episodes  a release date for the patrick show is  unfortunately not fixed at this time  after screenwriter derek colston  recently commented on the future of the  john wick franchise it is now officially  known there will also be a fifth part of  the john  wick franchise deadline reported by  referring to lionsgate the film is  planned to be shot after zhang week 4 as  soon as keanu reeves is available in  early 2021.  lionsgate ceo john feldheymer also  announced that the fourth film will be  released on memorial day weekend in 2022  besides the plan the continental series  now even three  john wick productions are in the process  which fans can look forward to  after many fans have been relatively  optimistic about the avatar live  action adaptation of netflix lately  great disappointment is now emerging the  original creator do michael dente  martino and brian konitsko were highly  respected among fans  announced their withdrawal from the  netflix series a few days ago  the controversial thing is that the two  have by no means withdrawn tacitly but  have settled up with the streaming  service in an open letter  so the two wrote that they were  originally full of hope when they joined  the project in 2018 as showrunners and  producers because they thought they  could realize their vision for the  renegation but at the end of the day  this was not the case  the rest of the sentences also sound  anything but conciliatory which is why  many fans now blame netflix for the exit  the streaming service will have to  process this news first because the  original series  avatar has been ranked last month in the  usa as content that has stayed the top  10 for the longest time it seems that  netflix has pushed the stakes too high  and has not given the creators the  necessary freedom it will be exciting to  see whether netflix will continue to  hold onto the project under different  management or whether the damage caused  by the departure of dimartino and  konicko is now too great  due to the pandemic we will not be able  to attend any major conventions like the  comic con this year in the last week  some alternatives have emerged which can  be followed not only  free of charge but also comfortably from  your own living room  one of them is the 24-hour event dc  fandom on august 22nd  various trailers films in series with  their own panels and more can be  expected  among others you can look forward to  news from the batman  wonder woman 1984 aquaman and also black  adam  in addition dwayne the rock johnson  wrote a tweet a few days ago with a  short black animore fandom sneak peek  johnson can also be seen briefly as a  kind of motion capture figure standing  in the ruins of a temple  almost the same video but with batman  theme was also presented to us by  director matt reeves and the first title  logo of this suicide squad can be seen  on james gunn's twitter channel  for the batman as well as for the  suicide squad we assume that there will  be new information  up-to-date pictures and maybe even a  short teaser trailer  what's also rumored is that we can  expect a second trailer for wonder woman  1984  and zack snyder also announced that we  will see a trailer for his justice  league snyder cut for the first time  as you can already see the fandom will  not lack in thematic variety and we're  looking forward to the impressive lineup  of top  class guests will you also be  participating live at the fandom on  august 22nd  write it down in the comments a few days  ago deadline reported that there is now  finally a candidate for the new tron  part he's called garth davies and is  said to have convinced the responsible  people at disney to entrust him with  this important task  davis has so far been able to convince  mainly with smaller productions like the  multiple oscar-nominated lion  tron eras will certainly not be an easy  task for the director  after all the franchise can look back on  the cult film tron from 1982 and the  sequel tron legacy from 2010  after the decision was made three years  ago to create a new tron as a kind of  reboot  nothing happened for a long time this  will now change with the engagement of  davies as director and jared leto as  actor  and producer however according to the  usual industry magazines the green light  has not yet been given  as the existing script by jessie wigato  still has to be completed and further  developed  the title tron aerys was by the way  published by later on twitter but he  already deleted this post again and  wrote tweets without  a specific title we are curious who else  will be brought on board and hope we can  announce the official start of  production  soon the first two jurassic world parts  brought in fantastic  box office takings of around 3 billion  us dollars which is why the main focus  of director colin trevorov is now  naturally on a third part that is as  successful as possible  on twitter jurassic outpost has now  published a new picture of the set which  shows clear reference to jurassic park  2.  you can see a refrigerated container in  which a valuable cargo stored according  to the inscription  in addition the logo of john hammond's  biotech company  engine can be seen with the words side b  or illusorna below it  indicating the location of the second  jurassic park part at that time  many dinosaurs without teeth left in  sight b by next year at the latest with  the release we might finally find out  what happened on the island after the  third part  after all the jurassic world movies are  playing on illa nubla  jurassic world dominion is expected to  be released in cinemas on june 11  [Music]  2021  [Music]  bye

